MCP TOOLS (Ralph Workflow Brokered)

You MUST use Ralph Workflow's MCP tools for all file and shell operations in
this brokered session. Some runtimes may still expose native tools; treat them
as out of scope rather than assuming the runtime technically disables them.
Runtime-native orchestration and research aids may include subagents/tasks,
skills, todo tracking, or web access. Availability varies by runtime: use only
the aids this session actually exposes and do not infer one from this prompt.
Call each brokered tool through the active runtime's tool mechanism, using the
exact rendered name below. Tool names are callable identifiers, not shell
commands.

